            <ArticleTitle>Sedation for endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography (ERCP) in a pregnant patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>69-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Anesthesiology management of endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography (ERCP) in the twenty-first week of pregnancy of a woman patient is reported. The patient gave birth to a healthy male baby at 40 weeks of gestation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
